{"entry_id":"diary_0001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T10:00:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday I met Dr. Alvarez at the museum, and my cat Luna watched quietly from a bench. I noticed a weird painting and I felt weirdly sure it was hiding a message. After that we talked about tomorrow’s lecture, and I planned to write down everything. Then I heard Luna meow like she knew, and I decided to trust my gut.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday","I","met","Dr.","Alvarez","at","the","museum,","and","my","cat","Luna","watched","quietly","from","a","bench."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","I-PARTICIPANT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","I-ACTION","O","O","O"]},{"tokens":["I","noticed","a","weird","painting","and","I","felt","weirdly","sure","it","was","hiding","a","message."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT"]},{"tokens":["After","that","we","talked","about","tomorrow’s","lecture,","and","I","planned","to","write","down","everything."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-TEMPORAL","O","O","O","B-ACTION","O","B-ACTION","I-ACTION","O"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","heard","Luna","meow","like","she","knew,","and","I","decided","to","trust","my","gut."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-ACTION","O","O"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2,3,4]}
{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T09:30:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday I met Rosa at the market, and her orange cat kept hopping near my shoes. After that, I noticed the bakery door was stuck, so I told the owner we needed help. I thought the whole thing was going to get awkward, but Rosa just laughed. Next, my friend Sam and I checked the register for a loose key while the orange cat watched. Then I felt relieved when the owner finally fixed it; honestly, I wasn't sure it would work at all.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday","I","met","Rosa","at","the","market,","and","her","orange","cat","kept","hopping","near","my","shoes."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-ACTION","O","O","B-CONTENT"]},{"tokens":["After","that,","I","noticed","the","bakery","door","was","stuck,","so","I","told","the","owner","we","needed","help."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","I-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","O","O","O","B-ACTION","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT"]},{"tokens":["I","thought","the","whole","thing","was","going","to","get","awkward,","but","Rosa","just","laughed."],"bio_tags":["B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","O","O","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-ACTION"]},{"tokens":["Next,","my","friend","Sam","and","I","checked","the","register","for","a","loose","key","while","the","orange","cat","watched."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","O","B-CONTENT","I-CONTENT","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION"]},{"tokens":["Then","I","felt","relieved","when","the","owner","finally","fixed","it;","honestly,","I","wasn't","sure","it","would","work","at","all."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O","O","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-ACTION","O","O"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2,3,4,5]}
{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday, I met Dr. Alvarez at the café and he fixed my broken watch, which made me weirdly hopeful. Later, after dinner, I texted Sam and I thought it might annoy him, but the message felt safer than my doubts.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday,", "I", "met", "Dr.", "Alvarez", "at", "the", "café", "and", "he", "fixed", "my", "broken", "watch,", "which", "made", "me", "weirdly", "hopeful."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","I-PARTICIPANT","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-ACTION","O","O","B-BELIEF_CUE"]},{"tokens":["Later,", "after", "dinner,", "I", "texted", "Sam", "and", "I", "thought", "it", "might", "annoy", "him,", "but", "the", "message", "felt", "safer", "than", "my", "doubts."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","O","B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","B-ACTION","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-BELIEF_CUE"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2]}
{"entry_id":"diary_0001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Today I missed the train at 8:10, and I think maybe I left my wallet at home, because I heard a loud clang just after and got nervous.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Today","I","missed","the","train","at","8:10,","and","I","think","maybe","I","left","my","wallet","at","home,","because","I","heard","a","loud","clang","just","after","and","got","nervous."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-TEMPORAL","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","I-BELIEF_CUE","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-PERCEPTION","O","O","O","B-TEMPORAL","O","O","O","O"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1]}
{"entry_id":"diary_20260319_001","entry_timestamp":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","raw_text":"Yesterday, I met Amina at the tiny bookstore and I bought a secondhand atlas. Later, I wasn’t sure if it was lucky, but I thought the paper smelled like rain when I opened it.","nersamples":[{"tokens":["Yesterday,", "I", "met", "Amina", "at", "the", "tiny", "bookstore", "and", "I", "bought", "a", "secondhand", "atlas", "."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","B-PARTICIPANT","O","O","O","O","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O","B-CONTENT","O"]},{"tokens":["Later,", "I", "wasn’t", "sure", "if", "it", "was", "lucky,", "but", "I", "thought", "the", "paper", "smelled", "like", "rain", "when", "I", "opened", "it", "."],"bio_tags":["B-TEMPORAL","B-PARTICIPANT","O","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-BELIEF_CUE","O","O","B-PERCEPTION","O","B-CONTENT","O","B-PARTICIPANT","B-ACTION","O","O"]}],"sentence_ordering":[1,2]}
